Subject: [PATCH net-next v1 05/18] net: tx4939: use __ethtool_get_ksettings
Date: Mon, 26 Jan 2015 17:36:01 -0800
Message-Id: <1422322574-6188-6-git-send-email-ddecotig@gmail.com>
